    "created_at": "2026-04-20T13:16:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-20T13:16:28Z",
    "body": "> If we did something like this to option elements, should we do the same thing to every other interactive element in the browser, like button elements?\n\nAs I understand it, `inert` wasn’t designed for this purpose, and applying it to other interactive elements' content will break features like 'Find in Page' and 'caret navigation', just like it does with the select button.",
